{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947670/extras/534d32a75cf1ef40fc0ec32ff87735f9.poster.avif?t=1757942071\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947670/extras/534d32a75cf1ef40fc0ec32ff87735f9.webm?t=1757942071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947670/extras/534d32a75cf1ef40fc0ec32ff87735f9.mp4?t=1757942071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard the mall with a team of 1 to 4 players! </strong><br><strong>Step into the role of a night security guard in the demo version of the horror game Misery Nights! You will experience a 20-30 minute trial shift \u2014 a simplified first night in the shopping mall designed to introduce you to the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two AI-powered monsters</strong> from the main campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A vast floor</strong> of the mall with diverse retail spaces to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple interactable objects:</strong> security cameras, security room doors, and various fun props.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text &amp; Voice chat</strong> for team communication.<br><i>(Beware: Monsters hear your voice! The closer you are, the clearer they hear you.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual style</strong> that creates a tense, claustrophobic atmosphere.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947670?t=1757942071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co